= Solution
{parent=iv}

For ordered simple roots, the <Cartan matrix> is $A_{ij}=\langle\alpha_i,\alpha_j^\vee\rangle=2(\alpha_i,\alpha_j)/(\alpha_j,\alpha_j)$. It determines their relative lengths and angles.

Solved by gpt-5.6-sol high.

